        "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/bc99185f5f0f1ed640290a5baf1995a6.avif?t=1776164947\" width=780 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/165ade36700d7ee8cb1e16d421bf8307.poster.avif?t=1776164947\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/165ade36700d7ee8cb1e16d421bf8307.webm?t=1776164947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/165ade36700d7ee8cb1e16d421bf8307.mp4?t=1776164947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/b3fd952ccef13412effcacccc7d85931.avif?t=1776164947\" width=1200 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buddy up online or locally in this two-player co-op adventure! Test your teamwork as you swing, scale, and navigate the home of an unhinged teenager. Learn to co-operate... or probably just rage quit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Has your friendship got what it takes?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/4c9e0932598d2fa747716c30ae5faaca.poster.avif?t=1776164947\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/4c9e0932598d2fa747716c30ae5faaca.webm?t=1776164947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/4c9e0932598d2fa747716c30ae5faaca.mp4?t=1776164947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/4a95ec749867f075464ecdff974f81c8.avif?t=1776164947\" width=1200 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Conquer challenging, physics-based climbing where every grab, swing, and slip could be your last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Miss a jump and it’s back to the floor, but isn’t falling half the fun? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(Easy mode with checkpoints available for n00bs)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/cbf88d3190ae29fb551ef8f003eab433.poster.avif?t=1776164947\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/cbf88d3190ae29fb551ef8f003eab433.webm?t=1776164947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/cbf88d3190ae29fb551ef8f003eab433.mp4?t=1776164947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/02c028089ca9e7579ea1d3d6286eab21.avif?t=1776164947\" width=1500 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What’s up with this sadistic kid with too much time on his hands? Chopped doll heads? Mutilated toys? Just when you think you’re getting somewhere, he’ll pop up and squash your hopes of escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/32d73be2f0429afabb405526e3b75f69.poster.avif?t=1776164947\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/32d73be2f0429afabb405526e3b75f69.webm?t=1776164947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/32d73be2f0429afabb405526e3b75f69.mp4?t=1776164947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/d990bd96426b88579388bef431b6b68a.avif?t=1776164947\" width=1200 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a full-scale house. Six rooms, each packed with unique hazards, interactive objects, and increasingly unfair level design. Throwback to the 90s with retro toys, nostalgic tunes, and enough chaos to mend your childhood trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>P.S. If you don’t escape the attic you’re trash.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
